# Normal viewing needs no runtime secrets. Optional protected sharing requires
# SHARES_DB, SHARES_CREATE_KEY and SHARES_ENCRYPTION_KEY in the Worker runtime.
# See docs/SHARING_SETUP.md. Never put these secrets in VITE_* variables:
# Vite embeds those values
# in the public browser bundle.
#
# Cloudflare deployment authentication belongs in the Workers Builds dashboard,
# not in this application environment file. Never commit CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN.
